## 🔬 What I'm Exploring

- 🔎 Developing and testing SIEM detection rules.
- 🛡️ Creating threat-hunting playbooks mapped to MITRE ATT&CK.
- 🕵️ Practicing structured digital forensics and incident response.
- ⚙️ Exploring automated IOC enrichment and alert triage.
- 📈 Improving detection quality and investigation workflows.
- 🤖 Exploring AI-assisted SOC operations with human-led validation.

---

## 🎯 My Security Philosophy

> Good security is not just about generating alerts. It's about finding meaningful signals, validating evidence, understanding root causes, and continuously improving defenses.

I value evidence-driven investigations, actionable detections, clear documentation, reproducible testing, and responsible security research in authorized environments.

